# Environment variables

Copy to `.env.local` for local development, and set the same keys in the Vercel project.

## Required for Relay (control plane, resolve, webhooks)

```
MONGO_URL=mongodb+srv://USER:PASS@CLUSTER.mongodb.net/
DB_NAME=nyttolabs
ADMIN_EMAILS=you@nyttolabs.com,@nyttolabs.com
ADMIN_PASSCODE=
RELAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
```

`MONGODB_URI` is accepted as an alias for `MONGO_URL`. The public website no longer 500s if Mongo is missing: it serves the in-code product catalog instead. Relay routes (`/api/resolve`, `/control`, partner inquiries) return 503 until Mongo is configured.

## Recommended

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://www.nyttolabs.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_BUSINESS_NAME=Nytto Labs
DEMO_MODE=false
CORS_ORIGINS=*
```

Point `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` at the public origin used in Relay `redirect_url` values. Production canonical is `https://www.nyttolabs.com`.

## Optional product URL overrides

Canonical live URLs are in `lib/relay/catalog.js`. Override only if a product moves
(`PRODUCT_URL_CYCLETAG` is no longer read; StayTag uses `PRODUCT_URL_STAYTAG`):

```
PRODUCT_URL_STAYTAG=https://staytag.nyttolabs.com/
PRODUCT_URL_VIESPROOF=https://viesproof.eu/
PRODUCT_URL_GATEZERO=https://getgatezero.com/
PRODUCT_URL_FAILCLOSED=https://failclosed.nyttolabs.com/
```

Do not put personal inboxes in `supportEmail` / `partnerEmail` settings. The public site publishes only `hello@`, `support@`, `privacy@`, and `billing@nyttolabs.com` (partnerships use `hello@`).

Do not commit personnummer, VAT IDs, residential addresses, or registration documents. Public legal copy lives in `lib/site.js` (operator, F-tax approval, VAT registered — no identity numbers).

# Google Search Console: HTML-tag verification token (content="..." value only).
# When set, the site emits <meta name="google-site-verification">.
GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=

# Claude (optional). Server-side only — never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Used by AI triage in /control (only when an admin presses "Analyze") and by
# the tool finder on the home page. Set a spend limit in the Anthropic Console.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# The home page tool finder asks Claude at most this many times per UTC day
# (counted in MongoDB), then falls back to a keyword match. 0 turns Claude off
# for the finder. Default 200.
FINDER_DAILY_LIMIT=

# Email notification when a partner inquiry or contact message arrives (optional).
# Requires RESEND_API_KEY. NOTIFY_FROM must use a domain verified in Resend;
# without it, Resend's test sender only delivers to the Resend account owner.
NOTIFY_EMAIL=
NOTIFY_FROM=
